{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bc0534d38989e0295b0f0f0336b4733a314e8c5e5a11069110aa0411d1925d18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:324d77280355d012416a9b9a2c128102be902d805af640930200be096b87a95a",
      "text": "作为杀青庆祝，工作人员给全员演职人员\n分发了纪念品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8f7d6bb9ccf01a9cc520a4428d21ef24765e0ac7731ee69ace396d1676bde0b",
      "text": "是拍摄时用过的面具。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f933783b2c440245573b411500eb4a759da1f7968c7f9aae09e95597e3e2fa3",
      "text": "现场各种工作堆积如山吧。在此之上，\n竟然还准备了这样的惊喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd20e7f9b38424a5df89822b4d2c73b80668173b9eae162fe8422a881ccabc5",
      "text": "会成为很有纪念意义的\n物品呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5ed825a82a387d17902578f79a8b04b99c1c9e0a0b1b895d48500327c310f8",
      "text": "让人想起挑选\n面具的那一天呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b488549459a681865c16625039f60853ffaad3c156203d7455c5931b5bf788a",
      "text": "嗯，毕竟是精挑细选到满意为止的。\n留在手边也不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bf98eb68fd43d2c399ee0098115b94aef15d3942276d571588190f265db2cd",
      "text": "关于这件事我有事想和你商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7308af9a4fa2dc015578d19c116e97d8c7a147c3db53bf34e0a3ef70bb616718",
      "text": "虽然我觉得按礼节我们也该回个礼，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfa6428d971d73f6f5462fa3ba65c5f36e9e6aa466c412f5731193504b2f5f74",
      "text": "但听说参与那部电视剧的工作人员\n各自都开始接手下一份工作了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646b1ddbad7a14b1dd7cd971b3da41c318b33f9fbead31dcd1ed036129973a2c",
      "text": "今后大概也没有同一批工作人员聚齐的机会了吧。\n你有什么好建议吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f21e37a3083746a06e2380f74e947b712bcef1b755971985919e6db1bbe2bd41",
      "text": "电视剧播出后在SNS上\n写下感谢如何",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a076ff4f5d86325090a089d7abf8dc38673b9ba7e66381bb0079c4fe367b9daa",
      "text": "还有这一招啊。\n……感觉其他成员也会说自己也想写呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_401_2_4_005_01_09_a:2_4_005_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d15881a994372de4cf1f49b00c03f51afe9e471160eef974e422cc561208f086",
      "text": "这件事就由你转告给他们吧。\n拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
